{"id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-arithmetic.md","title":"Bounded Arithmetic","display":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","aliases":["72-df-bounded-arithmetic"],"display":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1; §1.2.1; §1.3.3","source_printed_pages":"82–83, 99","source_pdf_pages":"94–95, 111","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b321fe579fa583cd\" href=\"?note=b321fe579fa583cd\" title=\"72-df-bounded-quantifier\">72-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1; §1.2.1; §1.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82–83, 99"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"94–95, 111"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BA}\">\\(\\mathrm{BA}\\)</span> 在变量支持及公式集记号中缩写语言参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span>；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\">\\(L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_L=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathcal F_L=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_L=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathcal A_L=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a> 的一阶语法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\\)</span> 是下式定义的有界构造闭包条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_L\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_L\">\\(\\mathcal B_L\\)</span> 是其最小闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,t\">\\(x,t\\)</span> 在每一量词构造中均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b321fe579fa583cd\" href=\"?note=b321fe579fa583cd\" title=\"72-df-bounded-quantifier\">72-df-bounded-quantifier</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 是下式构造的锐有界公式集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 使用同样输入条件，但界项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|t|\">\\(|t|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 表示固定经典一阶逻辑中的可证性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal A_L\\subseteq X\\ \\land\\\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\neg A\\in X\\land(A\\land B)\\in X\\land(A\\lor B)\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\to\n((\\exists x\\leq t)A\\in X\\land(\\forall x\\leq t)A\\in X)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal B_L&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_L:\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal A_L\\subseteq X\\ \\land\\\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\neg A\\in X\\land(A\\land B)\\in X\\land(A\\lor B)\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\to\n((\\exists x\\leq t)A\\in X\\land(\\forall x\\leq t)A\\in X)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathcal B_L&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_L:\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\subseteq X\\ \\land\\\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\neg A\\in X\\land(A\\land B)\\in X\\land(A\\lor B)\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\to\n((\\exists x\\leq|t|)A\\in X\\land(\\forall x\\leq|t|)A\\in X)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{BA}}:\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\subseteq X\\ \\land\\\n\\forall A,B\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\neg A\\in X\\land(A\\land B)\\in X\\land(A\\lor B)\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in X\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\;\n\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\to\n((\\exists x\\leq|t|)A\\in X\\land(\\forall x\\leq|t|)A\\in X)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}&amp;:=\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{BA}}:\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_L(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal B_L\\;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_L(A):A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\vdash\\theta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundedTheory}_L(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal B_L\\;\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_L(A):A\\in\\Gamma\\}\\vdash\\theta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II 印刷 pp. 82–83、99（PDF pp. 94–95、111）。本原子补全“有界理论”与“有界公式”，保留原锐有界公式角色。</li>\n<li>两个闭包族均非空，因为全体公式集满足各自闭包条件；交集满足同样条件，故确为最小语法闭包。</li>\n<li>自由变量公理隐含全称闭包。“bounded theory”是可用有界开放公式公理化的性质，不要求其书写出的每个闭句公理都没有外层全称量词。</li>\n<li>旧跨书定义被本书明示语言替代；原多项缩写移到直接上游，删除未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Quant}\">\\(\\operatorname{Quant}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"b321fe579fa583cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}$；$\\mathcal F_L=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$、$\\mathcal A_L=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]] 的一阶语法。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"b321fe579fa583cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,t$ 在每一量词构造中均满足 $x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)$ 与 $x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)$（见 [[72-df-bounded-quantifier]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{BA}}=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_L=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_L=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BCl}_L(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathcal F_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_L","display":false},{"tex":"x,t","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SCl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"|t|","