hmetic]] 的定义；$\\mathcal F_T=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_T)$。本节已给出的输入包括 $I\\Delta_0,S_2^i,T_2^i,S_2,T_2$，$i\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic|df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic]]"},{"id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^0=\\mathcal B_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}$ 是本语言全部有界公式（[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]），$\\Delta_0^0\\text{-}\\mathrm{IND}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]。"},{"id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})$，$\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 及有界构造取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bounded-arithmetic|df-bounded-arithmetic — Bounded Arithmetic]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-bounded-arithmetic|72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["b321fe579fa583cd","5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}